# Patterns (regex) for links lychee should not check. See .github/workflows/check.yml

# Self-referential canonical / og:url. Checking our own domain from CI is flaky
# (Cloudflare bot rules, DNS propagation) and proves nothing useful.
^https?://craigcooper\.dev

# LinkedIn returns 999/403 to automated requests — not a broken link.
linkedin\.com
